repository-code: https://github.com/stylescape/unit.gl
url: https://www.unit.gl
abstract: >-
  unit.gl is a dynamic layout engine and design system built on SCSS.
  It provides a unified Q-unit measurement system, responsive breakpoints,
  typographic scales, aspect ratios, and utility functions for creating
  consistent, harmonious layouts across all screen sizes.
keywords:
  - layout engine
  - design system
  - SCSS
  - CSS
  - responsive design
  - typography
  - grid system
  - Q-unit
  - breakpoints
  - aspect ratios
license: MIT
